## Metadata

- Artefact: S04 Solution Concept Diagram
- Phase: a
- Purpose: Show the declaration, registry, invocation, MCP, OpenAPI/ingest and persistence components and the flows between them.
- Scope: The solution shape for the S04 slice only; workflow execution, signed MCP channel and domain actions belong to later slices.

## Entries

- **Component / crates/actions-derive** - {"detail": "A 10th workspace member with proc-macro = true because a proc macro cannot live in a normal crate; a hand-written registry would name each schema twice.", "objective": "Derive the spec value and inventory::submit! from #[action] tokens."}
- **Component / crates/actions Registry** - {"detail": "validate_name, from_inventory, assert_registry_consistent (six checks) and spec_hash live here.", "objective": "Collect inventory once into Registry and validate it."}
- **Flow / Invocation path** - {"detail": "Tenancy scope, then idempotency claim, then deadline, then one transaction composing mutation, action_invocation and audit_event.", "objective": "POST /api/actions/<name>/invocations drives the call."}
- **Component / MCP surface** - {"detail": "tools/list and tools/call read the same Registry; tools/list is scope-filtered.", "objective": "rmcp streamable HTTP at /mcp, one session per tenant."}
- **Component / OpenAPI fold and lock** - {"detail": "--print-openapi --write-lock regenerates served-spec.lock.json with a per-operation sha256; --check-lock exits 1 on any added, removed or changed operation.", "objective": "Fold a literal path item per action into the spec built from OpenApiRouter exports."}
- **Component / External ingester** - {"detail": "operationId maps to <resource>.<verb> where parseable, else (tag, path, method); spec and schema_hash are stored.", "objective": "openapiv3 reads a service's openapi.json and derives kind: external actions."}
- **Data / action_registry** - {"detail": "The table is taken verbatim from section 2.14; kind is external or workflow; RLS is ENABLE+FORCE+policy with grants.", "objective": "Persist external and workflow actions in migrations/0003_action_registry.sql."}
- **Flow / Boot assertion** - {"detail": "Exit 1 on an approved workflow row with no handler or an external row whose service is unconfigured.", "objective": "Fail startup before bind when the binary and DB disagree."}
